menu "WiFi cartridge"
    choice GBW_BOARD
        prompt "Board"
        default GBW_BOARD_CART
        config GBW_BOARD_CART
            bool "Cartridge Rev B (U104)"
        config GBW_BOARD_XIAO
            bool "Seeed XIAO ESP32C3 bench test (no ADC dividers: fixed full reservoir, USB power)"
            help
                Same SPI pins as the cart (D0 = IO2 MISO, D4 = IO6 SCK, D5 = IO7 MOSI, D10 = IO10 CS), so an RP2350
                (Pico 2 link tester) can be wired straight to it. IO0/IO1 are not on the XIAO's pins, so the power
                manager gets fixed readings. Never flash this onto a cart: it would ignore the real reservoir.
    endchoice
endmenu
